WEBVTT

00:13.638 --> 00:16.850
Do not chase the bone. Leave it be.

00:16.933 --> 00:20.812
Let his bone wander about freely.

00:20.895 --> 00:24.899
Then, I will combine it
with Jotaro Kujo's memory.

00:24.983 --> 00:26.943
I will learn the truth!

00:27.527 --> 00:31.573
The bone must have gotten
implanted inside this green fruit.

00:31.656 --> 00:36.202
Pale Snake is at this prison
to discover what lies beyond this point.

00:36.286 --> 00:38.413
What will it spawn?

00:38.496 --> 00:41.833
He wants to know
what transpires when it is born.

00:42.417 --> 00:43.918
We'll leave you to find its User

00:44.002 --> 00:45.670
and finish him off.

00:46.921 --> 00:48.047
Fuck…

00:48.131 --> 00:50.467
Who would have thought that was an attack?

00:51.301 --> 00:53.678
His bodily fluids… He used his spit

00:54.262 --> 00:57.098
to destroy my mouth before I realized it.

00:57.891 --> 01:00.477
He attacked me slowly, little by little.

01:01.436 --> 01:02.896
What should I do?

01:02.979 --> 01:05.023
Should I go after Jolyne's boat?

01:05.106 --> 01:06.024
No.

01:06.816 --> 01:08.026
I will stick to my mission

01:08.109 --> 01:11.279
and go finish off that Stand's User.

01:11.863 --> 01:13.323
This is the most definite way.

02:46.207 --> 02:48.543
EPISODE 20: F.F. - THE WITNESS

02:48.626 --> 02:49.544
Hey you.

02:50.128 --> 02:51.963
Head toward that island.

03:01.514 --> 03:05.393
Why are we stopping at this hidden place?

03:05.476 --> 03:08.688
Hey, turn off the engine.
Don't make a sound.

03:09.230 --> 03:10.773
Don't you hear that?

03:18.239 --> 03:21.659
I said hurry up
and turn off the engine, idiot!

03:26.039 --> 03:28.583
Emergency in the Disciplinary Wing area.

03:28.666 --> 03:31.669
The entire facility
is on Level 4 security.

03:31.753 --> 03:33.963
Stay on high alert!

03:34.881 --> 03:37.800
That's a 12.7mm M2 heavy machine gun.

03:37.884 --> 03:40.929
Its range is 1,000 to 2,000 meters.

03:41.554 --> 03:44.307
A mere graze from that bullet
would blow our limbs off.

03:44.390 --> 03:46.434
This old boat would be shot into pieces.

03:49.979 --> 03:51.064
Hey, shut up.

03:51.147 --> 03:52.982
You're shaking the boat.

03:53.566 --> 03:56.277
Stay away from the steering!

04:01.032 --> 04:02.158
Stay calm.

04:02.242 --> 04:05.828
If they had spotted us,
we would've been shot at.

04:06.871 --> 04:07.956
Ten o'clock.

04:08.039 --> 04:10.541
There was an unusual splashing
by the bushes.

04:10.625 --> 04:12.210
Maybe a fish or an alligator?

04:12.877 --> 04:15.171
They're coming. We should leave!

04:17.757 --> 04:21.427
Grab the leaves like this, master.

04:21.511 --> 04:24.681
I told you to be quiet, dimwit!

04:24.764 --> 04:29.143
No. I'm folding these leaves in half.

04:31.229 --> 04:34.983
Here, let's weave it and rest it here.

04:39.445 --> 04:40.780
Stick them here like this.

04:43.199 --> 04:45.868
And now, let's paint your face.

04:51.582 --> 04:52.458
Excellent.

04:52.542 --> 04:55.753
Good, now let's get your face ready.

05:11.311 --> 05:12.562
Emergency report!

05:12.645 --> 05:14.439
All guards,
return to the Disciplinary Wing!

05:14.522 --> 05:16.399
I repeat, everyone back to their posts!

05:16.983 --> 05:18.276
Turn back?

05:18.359 --> 05:21.529
I'm not sure what's happening,
but it sounds pretty serious.

05:21.612 --> 05:22.447
Let's head back.

05:30.496 --> 05:33.166
Where the hell did these guys come from?

05:35.752 --> 05:39.047
Damn! Turn the engine on, hurry up!

05:39.130 --> 05:40.423
It won't start in time!

05:40.506 --> 05:42.884
We'll get shot before it gets going!

05:42.967 --> 05:46.596
You there! What have you done
at the Disciplinary Wing?

06:00.985 --> 06:03.321
Listen! Do not move!

06:03.905 --> 06:06.657
Put your hands on the floor! Stay down!

06:07.575 --> 06:10.578
I said don't move, bastard!

06:10.661 --> 06:12.622
Hit the ground, now!

06:15.583 --> 06:18.336
- Our boat!
- We can take their boat.

06:18.419 --> 06:19.879
And you're doing it for us.

06:30.348 --> 06:31.516
What just hit us?

06:33.643 --> 06:35.520
I'm taking this boat.

06:35.603 --> 06:38.981
I'm sure you don't mind. Don't get eaten
by alligators on your way back.

06:39.899 --> 06:41.359
Diver Drive!

06:44.320 --> 06:46.989
Jolyne, are the plants
still growing inside you?

06:47.573 --> 06:51.577
Let's continue heading east.
The sun is still going down.

06:52.161 --> 06:56.082
So mean, tossing me around
like I was a sack…

06:56.666 --> 06:57.625
Oh, well.

07:13.808 --> 07:17.854
Hey Jolyne, I'm sorry,
but can you stop whistling?

07:19.397 --> 07:22.900
We might hear the guards' boats again.

07:23.443 --> 07:24.861
WHAT ARE YOU SAYING, ANASTASIA?

07:26.195 --> 07:28.823
ANASTASIA! HEY, CAN YOU HEAR ME?

07:30.408 --> 07:31.742
I can't speak!

07:37.498 --> 07:40.376
ANASTASIA!
MY VOICE! IT'S NOT COMING OUT!

07:41.752 --> 07:42.587
ANASTASIA!

07:45.673 --> 07:46.716
This Stand…

07:47.300 --> 07:51.012
He's here to do more than
just run off with the green child!

07:51.095 --> 07:53.181
He was slowly attacking us!

07:54.098 --> 07:55.641
What's the matter?

07:55.725 --> 07:57.977
You are breathing hard.

08:01.606 --> 08:02.982
I feel the same way, Jolyne.

08:03.774 --> 08:05.401
Can you feel my heart pounding?

08:05.485 --> 08:07.278
You are suddenly getting close to me.

08:07.361 --> 08:10.865
Do you finally understand
how I feel for you?

08:14.494 --> 08:16.913
Not my eyes, my tongue!

08:17.788 --> 08:19.874
Are you at a loss for words?

08:21.792 --> 08:24.086
I know how you feel.

08:24.670 --> 08:27.089
But there's no need for words between us.

08:27.173 --> 08:28.883
I feel the same about you.

08:29.800 --> 08:31.594
You're dying to kiss me, right?

08:31.677 --> 08:35.556
You want a deep kiss already?

08:39.810 --> 08:45.191
When, and how did he attack us?
I didn't notice at all.

08:45.274 --> 08:47.610
I have to keep him in my sights!

08:55.493 --> 08:56.369
Jolyne…

08:58.913 --> 08:59.997
Well, which is it?

09:00.081 --> 09:02.583
Do you want to kiss, or not?

09:03.084 --> 09:07.672
I know, is this a kink?

09:08.297 --> 09:10.800
Like, you are particular about
your kissing angle…

09:12.343 --> 09:14.637
An auto-tracking Stand.

09:14.720 --> 09:19.100
It follows our orders like a slave
and acts docile like a servant.

09:19.183 --> 09:20.726
It pretends to be harmless.

09:20.810 --> 09:23.604
But that's his method.

09:23.688 --> 09:26.315
It's a Stand that strikes

09:26.399 --> 09:28.693
when its prey lets their guard down!

09:29.360 --> 09:31.404
At this rate, we're both toast.

09:38.661 --> 09:40.204
Bring it on.

09:40.288 --> 09:41.581
Try to attack me.

09:42.164 --> 09:44.125
I must make Anastasia see
what's happening.

09:49.046 --> 09:51.007
YA-YA MA.

09:51.090 --> 09:53.593
That's my name.

09:53.676 --> 09:55.261
YA-YA MA.

09:55.344 --> 09:59.098
Let me show you how to tan frog hide.
Look here.

09:59.181 --> 10:04.937
Rub this mixture made of fat and brains
all creamy and thick

10:05.021 --> 10:08.149
on the back of the frog skin.

10:08.232 --> 10:11.569
This smoothes the hide.

10:12.153 --> 10:15.698
If you want, I can go get ten more

10:15.781 --> 10:20.411
and tailor up the coolest
super mini-skirt using their hide.

10:20.494 --> 10:25.791
It'll make your legs look ultra-long
and slim, and your hips will look wide!

10:26.375 --> 10:29.211
Jolyne, what is the matter? Seriously.

10:29.795 --> 10:32.298
If a trigger is necessary,

10:32.381 --> 10:35.134
there must be a trigger to his attacks!

10:35.217 --> 10:37.720
And if they're automatic, then…

10:51.150 --> 10:52.276
This is what I was waiting for.

10:53.069 --> 10:56.405
I covered my skin with my threads
and waited for something to touch it.

10:56.989 --> 11:00.409
His attacks set off automatically
when we turn away.

11:00.493 --> 11:02.119
That's his ability.

11:02.203 --> 11:05.373
And now, I know how he attacks.

11:05.956 --> 11:06.874
He uses mosquitoes!

11:06.957 --> 11:09.543
Jolyne, what's going on?

11:14.340 --> 11:15.174
Jolyne!

11:15.257 --> 11:17.760
Was I wrong? Does he not use mosquitoes?

11:17.843 --> 11:21.972
Or is he attacking in other ways too?

11:24.058 --> 11:27.061
BE ALL EYES
DON'T EVER LOOK AWAY

11:29.063 --> 11:30.231
You…

11:30.314 --> 11:32.233
Bastard!

11:32.316 --> 11:38.739
Master, you want me
to keep driving this boat?

11:38.823 --> 11:43.828
Or do you want to fight me one-on-one?

11:43.911 --> 11:44.954
Or will you escape--

11:49.917 --> 11:52.503
I was wrong. He doesn't use mosquitoes.

11:52.586 --> 11:55.005
He attacks in other ways.

11:55.089 --> 11:56.924
Yes, give me more!

12:00.344 --> 12:04.223
He attacks in a way that
can't be seen by the naked eye!

12:04.306 --> 12:05.224
Run!

12:05.307 --> 12:09.687
I do believe this is
your last chance to escape.

12:10.771 --> 12:12.481
I hope you are prepared.

12:13.357 --> 12:18.195
Prepared to regret ever being born
in this world.

12:23.284 --> 12:24.952
STAND NAME: DIVER DRIVE
STAND MASTER: NARCISO ANASTASIA

12:25.536 --> 12:28.789
Go to the back of the boat,
at the corner of the port!

12:34.920 --> 12:37.256
Take out everything you're hiding.

12:37.339 --> 12:40.384
Spread them out by my feet.
Now, show them to me!

12:40.968 --> 12:45.055
Two rhino beetles,
a microphone for singing,

12:45.139 --> 12:49.518
low-calorie sugar packs, and three frogs.

12:49.602 --> 12:53.439
One raw frog hide, a bundle of broccoli,

12:53.522 --> 12:57.109
four mock strawberries,
and two used matchsticks.

12:58.569 --> 13:00.404
No, his belongings are irrelevant.

13:00.488 --> 13:05.367
We are upwind of him,
yet he is able to attack us.

13:06.243 --> 13:11.832
An auto-tracking Stand…
Your target is set, is that right?

13:11.916 --> 13:15.169
Yes sir, my target is absolutely locked on

13:15.252 --> 13:18.297
to Jolyne Cujoh since
the very first time I touched her.

13:19.256 --> 13:22.384
Your User commanded you to target her.

13:22.968 --> 13:26.680
You won't try to escape
until you've finished her off.

13:26.764 --> 13:28.474
YA-YA MA.

13:28.557 --> 13:31.894
And if you want to be by her side, master,

13:32.394 --> 13:36.232
I will finish you off along with Jolyne.

13:42.071 --> 13:43.989
Could he be using his spit to attack?

13:44.073 --> 13:45.658
YA-YA MA.

13:45.741 --> 13:47.910
You still don't get it, do you?

13:47.993 --> 13:52.456
You can't destroy or stop me, ever.

13:52.540 --> 13:55.167
The only way to survive

13:55.251 --> 14:00.339
was to run away from me.

14:02.049 --> 14:04.802
This boat… Should I stop it?

14:05.427 --> 14:07.137
This splattering water…

14:07.721 --> 14:10.432
If the spit he uses to attack

14:10.516 --> 14:13.644
has already permeated
the wetland waters, then…

14:13.727 --> 14:16.855
Now, stand and go to the driver's seat.

14:16.939 --> 14:18.816
Crank up the speed.

14:19.400 --> 14:21.235
Now get up.

14:21.318 --> 14:23.279
No, you'll make things worse.

14:24.613 --> 14:29.243
If you speed up the boat,
the water will splash everywhere.

14:31.203 --> 14:34.957
Yes, if that's what you want, master.

14:56.228 --> 14:57.062
Ribbit!

14:57.146 --> 15:03.694
Jolyne, he stopped attacking
although the boat's speed hadn't changed.

15:10.743 --> 15:12.494
YA-YA MA.

15:12.578 --> 15:14.663
Something's not right…

15:15.873 --> 15:18.834
Birds! Hide!

15:22.254 --> 15:24.131
Diver Drive.

15:24.214 --> 15:27.551
I don't care how he attacks.

15:28.177 --> 15:31.597
Since he is a perfect auto-tracking Stand,

15:31.680 --> 15:33.682
I buried a frog in his head

15:33.766 --> 15:37.895
and connected its brain
to his tracking sensors.

15:38.479 --> 15:42.024
Try to track us as a frog
as long as you exist!

15:44.526 --> 15:48.364
Wait… what was I going to do?

15:48.447 --> 15:50.824
I am an auto-tracking Stand.

15:50.908 --> 15:56.288
My mission is to defeat Jolyne Cujoh
and return with the green child.

15:56.372 --> 15:57.331
Oh, dear.

15:57.414 --> 15:59.792
I have no time to be bumming around!

15:59.875 --> 16:03.087
I have to spatter my spit
to attack Anastasia!

16:03.170 --> 16:05.255
I'll create a static charge
by causing friction

16:05.339 --> 16:07.132
between the plastic and the propellers.

16:07.216 --> 16:10.844
That'll make my spit fly everywhere!

16:10.928 --> 16:14.556
He'll never figure it out!

16:15.432 --> 16:18.519
Oh, but those birds are so scary!

16:18.602 --> 16:20.187
Hide!

16:20.270 --> 16:24.149
Ew, I peed myself like those frogs do!

16:25.275 --> 16:29.321
Woah, what a cutie! Look at those curves!

16:29.405 --> 16:32.282
Let me ride you, darling!

16:32.366 --> 16:34.076
Oh, a rhino beetle!

16:36.954 --> 16:39.331
He won't bother us anymore.

16:39.415 --> 16:42.334
We need F.F.'s help to heal the wounds.

16:42.418 --> 16:43.836
All we need to do

16:43.919 --> 16:46.922
is wait for F.F. to finish D an' G off
and meet up with us.

16:51.677 --> 16:55.305
What the hell happened
to the Disciplinary Wing?

16:55.931 --> 16:58.350
Where are the guards and the prisoners?

16:58.434 --> 17:00.644
We've only been gone
for around ten minutes!

17:00.728 --> 17:03.564
Where did these plants even come from?

17:03.647 --> 17:05.607
How do we explain this?

17:05.691 --> 17:07.234
What is that prisoner's condition?

17:07.317 --> 17:08.902
Is he able to talk?

17:09.486 --> 17:14.158
Prisoner ME14067, D an' G.

17:14.241 --> 17:17.911
He is in critical condition.
His right arm almost got ripped off.

17:17.995 --> 17:19.246
We can't question him.

17:19.997 --> 17:26.587
I'll blow his head off for setting loose
a Stand that's creepy as hell.

17:37.806 --> 17:42.186
That man, isn't he
the prison's priest, Father Pucchi?

17:43.312 --> 17:45.481
What is a priest doing here?

17:46.690 --> 17:48.859
Shit, forget about him for now.

17:48.942 --> 17:52.780
What's more important
is the definite death of D an' G.

17:54.782 --> 17:56.241
Three hundred fifty-nine.

17:56.325 --> 17:57.910
Three hundred sixty-seven.

17:57.993 --> 17:59.453
Three hundred seventy-three.

17:59.536 --> 18:00.996
Three hundred seventy-nine.

18:01.080 --> 18:04.249
Three hundred eighty-three.
Three hundred eighty-nine.

18:04.333 --> 18:05.626
Three hundred ninety-seven.

18:05.709 --> 18:08.712
And now, the four hundreds.

18:08.796 --> 18:10.589
First, four hundred one.

18:10.672 --> 18:12.091
Then, four hundred nine.

18:12.174 --> 18:16.303
D an' G is gravely injured, meaning…

18:16.804 --> 18:21.058
I must conclude that
Jolyne Cujoh is still alive.

18:21.141 --> 18:25.479
And the plethora of withered plants…

18:25.562 --> 18:28.649
I take it that Dio's bone caused this.

18:28.732 --> 18:31.777
Dio's bone is using the prisoners' bodies

18:31.860 --> 18:36.240
to accomplish something
outside of my imagination.

18:36.323 --> 18:37.491
Splendid.

18:37.574 --> 18:38.826
This is wonderful.

18:38.909 --> 18:41.578
So it has finally begun.

18:41.662 --> 18:45.457
I've been waiting for this moment
for 22 years.

18:45.541 --> 18:48.043
What D an' G witnessed here…

18:48.127 --> 18:51.171
I must ask him what he saw, in person!

18:52.464 --> 18:57.511
Isn't that right, Survivor's Guccio?
It seems you didn't see what happened,

18:57.594 --> 19:00.848
but the plants must have set
something in motion.

19:00.931 --> 19:03.559
Doesn't this call for a celebration?

19:03.642 --> 19:06.395
It will be in my hands soon.

19:06.478 --> 19:09.606
What is true happiness?

19:09.690 --> 19:11.817
I will attain heaven.

19:12.693 --> 19:16.947
Sing praises. The thing that will be born
is heaven itself.

19:17.030 --> 19:21.660
The curtains to the new world have risen.

19:33.797 --> 19:35.174
Splendid…

19:35.257 --> 19:37.676
Yes, praise this moment!

19:37.759 --> 19:42.097
Handel's "Messiah" is a true masterpiece!

19:46.143 --> 19:48.770
How befitting…

19:48.854 --> 19:51.023
It's as if the music exudes light.

19:51.565 --> 19:57.529
It is said that Handel led this piece
even the day before his own death!

19:59.698 --> 20:02.409
All right, leave D an' G to the medics.

20:02.492 --> 20:04.077
Question him after his treatment.

20:04.161 --> 20:08.582
We must search for
the other prisoners and guards.

20:08.665 --> 20:10.209
- Now, go.
- Yes, sir.

20:17.466 --> 20:21.637
No, I will question him
before he is treated.

20:21.720 --> 20:26.391
I must not let
what was conceived get lost!

20:27.059 --> 20:28.810
Good. Now, start the car.

20:28.894 --> 20:29.770
Yes, sir.

20:38.570 --> 20:40.656
That woman…

20:40.739 --> 20:43.367
That face underneath the hat!

20:47.496 --> 20:48.455
You're done now.

20:48.538 --> 20:51.333
Those who control auto-tracking Stands

20:51.416 --> 20:54.044
are defenseless
when the tables turn on them.

20:54.127 --> 20:55.420
That's the risk you bear!

20:56.004 --> 20:57.381
It's F.F.!

20:57.464 --> 20:59.466
Why are they at this Disciplinary Wing?

20:59.549 --> 21:01.468
Since when? This is bad!

21:02.427 --> 21:04.012
They were after D an' G!

21:07.391 --> 21:08.558
He has a disc!

21:11.979 --> 21:13.647
Pale Snake is nearby!

21:14.398 --> 21:15.357
Where is he?

21:15.440 --> 21:18.110
Where did he throw the disc from?

21:18.193 --> 21:20.404
Four hundred seventy-nine.

21:20.487 --> 21:22.322
Four hundred eighty-seven.

21:23.365 --> 21:25.117
Four hundred ninety-one.

21:25.701 --> 21:27.995
Four hundred ninety-nine.

21:28.078 --> 21:29.371
No way…

21:29.454 --> 21:30.622
The one who threw it was…

21:31.623 --> 21:32.749
It can't be him!

21:33.542 --> 21:36.336
This is bad. It's very bad for me.

21:37.337 --> 21:40.882
You are able to attack D an 'G
here and now

21:40.966 --> 21:46.388
because his Stand
YA-YA MA is tracking Jolyne.

21:46.471 --> 21:47.639
Pale Snake's User is…

21:48.640 --> 21:49.850
This can't be!

21:50.475 --> 21:53.729
There are things I must learn from him.

21:53.812 --> 21:56.356
I cannot have him die yet.

21:56.440 --> 21:58.775
So the one who controls Pale Snake is…

21:59.735 --> 22:02.029
If that's true, then what?

22:02.112 --> 22:04.114
Which do you prioritize?

22:04.197 --> 22:05.699
Is it me?

22:05.782 --> 22:09.494
Or is it finishing D an' G?

22:09.578 --> 22:11.038
You are…

22:11.121 --> 22:12.456
Father Pucchi.

22:13.290 --> 22:15.167
You bastard!

23:41.336 --> 23:46.341
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
